{"status": "ok", "language": "zh-Hant", "cues": [{"t": 0.94, "d": 2.63, "text": "我们现在正在路边等出租车"}, {"t": 2.62, "d": 4.93, "text": "。 今天我们要去一家新的"}, {"t": 6.6, "d": 2.75, "text": "购物中心，我将带你们参观一下"}, {"t": 8.39, "d": 4.9, "text": "中国购物中心。 我刚叫了辆"}, {"t": 12.33, "d": 4.4, "text": "出租车，现在正在等车。 我们"}, {"t": 15.78, "d": 5.21, "text": "现在在出租车里。 这家商场"}, {"t": 20.04, "d": 2.91, "text": "离我家三公里，"}, {"t": 22.0, "d": 4.64, "text": "打车大约需要十分钟。 不到"}, {"t": 25.69, "d": 1.62, "text": "十分钟。"}, {"t": 28.53, "d": 2.63, "text": "我们已经到达商场，"}, {"t": 31.75, "d": 5.51, "text": "外面停着很多电动滑板车。 这里有一家很大的餐厅，专门"}, {"t": 36.3, "d": 5.26, "text": "供应鱼类菜肴。 等等，肯德基，"}, {"t": 40.64, "d": 2.99, "text": "它怎么变成了“K-Coffee”？"}, {"t": 45.16, "d": 1.75, "text": "我猜应该是他们旗下的咖啡品牌。"}, {"t": 46.2, "d": 3.54, "text": "他们旗下的咖啡品牌。 哦，"}, {"t": 48.79, "d": 4.59, "text": "那边有一家星巴克。"}, {"t": 52.43, "d": 2.87, "text": "这里的园林景观很不错； 我们可以"}, {"t": 54.35, "d": 2.57, "text": "走下去看看，稍后再去。"}, {"t": 58.08, "d": 2.72, "text": "这里有条人行道，我们走吧。"}, {"t": 61.83, "d": 2.63, "text": "这些吊灯看起来和我"}, {"t": 63.5, "d": 1.63, "text": "家乡的一模一样。"}, {"t": 67.35, "d": 2.79, "text": "哦，对了，树上的星月灯"}, {"t": 69.19, "d": 2.84, "text": "，晚上一定很漂亮"}, {"t": 71.08, "d": 1.29, "text": "。"}, {"t": 76.3, "d": 2.73, "text": "这里有一个花瓶形状的凉亭。"}, {"t": 80.9, "d": 3.3, "text": "里面有一些凳子、椅子"}, {"t": 83.27, "d": 5.33, "text": "和小桌子。 你可以在这里休息；"}, {"t": 87.65, "d": 5.77, "text": "它有点像鸟笼。 这里有一家"}, {"t": 92.46, "d": 2.94, "text": "火锅店，是连锁店。"}, {"t": 95.65, "d": 5.53, "text": "它们在这里很常见。 而"}, {"t": 100.22, "d": 2.54, "text": "最顶层的那个“电影院”就是"}, {"t": 101.8, "d": 7.02, "text": "电影院。 远处还有"}, {"t": 107.86, "d": 2.3, "text": "一些正在建设中的建筑物"}, {"t": 109.21, "d": 12.25, "text": "。 现在我们进去吧。 哇，"}, {"t": 120.52, "d": 3.17, "text": "天花板看起来真不错。"}, {"t": 126.12, "d": 2.95, "text": "这边有一些科技品牌店，都是"}, {"t": 128.13, "d": 2.9, "text": "中国本土电子品牌。"}, {"t": 134.28, "d": 2.74, "text": "这家美国披萨连锁店"}, {"t": 136.07, "d": 5.62, "text": "在中国叫做达美乐。 达美乐披萨，这"}, {"t": 140.75, "d": 6.87, "text": "家看起来很干净……这是"}, {"t": 146.68, "d": 5.88, "text": "桃子。 这里有一些烘焙食品，还有一些"}, {"t": 151.6, "d": 5.08, "text": "面包。 这是什么？ 坚果馅"}, {"t": 155.74, "d": 6.63, "text": "软面包。 一个包售价11.8元。 这"}, {"t": 161.44, "d": 5.54, "text": "是贝果，两个贝果。  10元。 再"}, {"t": 166.02, "d": 6.42, "text": "往前走一点，还有一些饮料。"}, {"t": 171.49, "d": 2.59, "text": "这里写着“无需查看"}, {"t": 173.12, "d": 3.0, "text": "成分表”，意思是标签"}, {"t": 175.17, "d": 7.43, "text": "非常干净。 干果。 三文鱼脆片"}, {"t": 181.6, "d": 2.81, "text": "，竟然是牛排味的！"}, {"t": 184.7, "d": 2.82, "text": "柠檬片可以泡在"}, {"t": 186.58, "d": 4.46, "text": "水里饮用。 这个大包售价12.8"}, {"t": 190.12, "d": 3.98, "text": "元。 这里总共有三层楼"}, {"t": 193.15, "d": 2.69, "text": "，我们上去几层看看吧？"}, {"t": 196.39, "d": 2.64, "text": "我们上两层去，那里有一家"}, {"t": 198.08, "d": 4.65, "text": "精品店。 这是一个手机挂饰。"}, {"t": 204.32, "d": 4.61, "text": "挺可爱的。 这里有很多毛绒"}, {"t": 207.98, "d": 5.76, "text": "玩具。 这里有一面镜子，还有"}, {"t": 212.78, "d": 6.7, "text": "很多可爱的小杯子。 这些是"}, {"t": 218.54, "d": 2.9, "text": "酒杯，这里还有一些手镯，"}, {"t": 220.49, "d": 4.89, "text": "非常漂亮。 这是耳环。"}, {"t": 226.49, "d": 3.36, "text": "项链、减压玩具——它其实是一个"}, {"t": 228.91, "d": 1.81, "text": "键盘按键。"}, {"t": 231.8, "d": 2.0, "text": "它在网上有售。"}, {"t": 233.12, "d": 3.45, "text": "亚马逊上也有。 这很不错，"}, {"t": 235.62, "d": 3.03, "text": "而且它还会发光，就像我的键盘一样"}, {"t": 237.66, "d": 1.05, "text": "。"}, {"t": 238.94, "d": 2.56, "text": "但真正工作的人会"}, {"t": 240.55, "d": 2.48, "text": "真的想用这种方式来缓解"}, {"t": 242.07, "d": 1.3, "text": "压力吗？"}, {"t": 242.96, "d": 2.65, "text": "他们整天都在敲键盘。"}, {"t": 244.71, "d": 1.45, "text": "真的。"}, {"t": 245.88, "d": 5.62, "text": "这是一个拼图游戏。 这是"}, {"t": 250.55, "d": 2.57, "text": "小米的电动汽车； 它就停在"}, {"t": 252.16, "d": 2.71, "text": "商场过道的正中间，"}, {"t": 253.91, "d": 4.72, "text": "人人都看得见。 我们"}, {"t": 257.68, "d": 2.73, "text": "现在乘电梯上去； 这是他们"}, {"t": 259.45, "d": 4.4, "text": "玩电子游戏的地方。 有点吵。"}, {"t": 265.63, "d": 2.49, "text": "这层楼有很多餐馆"}, {"t": 267.17, "d": 4.62, "text": "。 这些是商场里的按摩"}, {"t": 270.83, "d": 5.05, "text": "椅。 如果您购物"}, {"t": 274.93, "d": 2.76, "text": "累了，可以坐下来享受按摩。"}, {"t": 279.08, "d": 2.77, "text": "这里有一家叫加州"}, {"t": 280.9, "d": 4.7, "text": "健身的健身房。 现在我们乘电梯到"}, {"t": 284.64, "d": 4.03, "text": "三楼去看看。"}, {"t": 287.71, "d": 2.5, "text": "三楼有什么东西？"}, {"t": 290.0, "d": 3.37, "text": "这里有家电影院。 通常，"}, {"t": 292.43, "d": 3.22, "text": "中国商场的顶层都是"}, {"t": 294.71, "d": 4.55, "text": "电影院。 我们现在"}, {"t": 298.31, "d": 2.62, "text": "直接从三楼出口离开。"}, {"t": 303.32, "d": 2.88, "text": "这里有个游乐场，是"}, {"t": 305.25, "d": 5.73, "text": "孩子们玩耍的地方。 哦，那边还有一个"}, {"t": 310.04, "d": 3.02, "text": "宠物休息区，是"}, {"t": 312.12, "d": 4.99, "text": "宠物放松的地方。 这里写着：“宠物"}, {"t": 316.16, "d": 5.2, "text": "游乐区，儿童禁止入内。” 这是"}, {"t": 320.42, "d": 4.92, "text": "给小狗玩耍的。在中国，我们"}, {"t": 324.39, "d": 2.85, "text": "也称宠物为“毛孩子”，因为"}, {"t": 326.29, "d": 2.9, "text": "它们毛很多，就像"}, {"t": 328.24, "d": 4.84, "text": "人类的孩子一样。"}, {"t": 332.13, "d": 3.92, "text": "这里甚至还有宠物爪印。 现在，我们乘"}, {"t": 335.11, "d": 3.58, "text": "电梯下去吧。 我们要去哪里？"}, {"t": 338.56, "d": 2.03, "text": "到地下室。"}, {"t": 340.31, "d": 2.7, "text": "好的，我们去地下室吧。"}, {"t": 343.2, "d": 1.71, "text": "美食广场。"}, {"t": 345.99, "d": 3.0, "text": "没错，那里通常是一条美食街，有"}, {"t": 348.05, "d": 5.08, "text": "很多小吃。 我们现在已经到达"}, {"t": 352.18, "d": 2.83, "text": "地下停车场，需要"}, {"t": 354.06, "d": 2.59, "text": "穿过它； 超市"}, {"t": 355.7, "d": 5.45, "text": "领先一步。 现在我们到了"}, {"t": 360.2, "d": 3.03, "text": "超市，这里出售鲜花、"}, {"t": 362.29, "d": 5.64, "text": "红豆和面包。 吐司。 这一整"}, {"t": 366.97, "d": 3.99, "text": "排都是即食食品。 这些是"}, {"t": 370.01, "d": 2.7, "text": "鱼丸，串起来的鱼丸。"}, {"t": 372.92, "d": 2.73, "text": "我们需要在外面付钱吗？ 买"}, {"t": 374.71, "d": 1.17, "text": "吧。"}, {"t": 376.57, "d": 7.06, "text": "我很少在这里买东西。 这片区域是种植"}, {"t": 382.68, "d": 3.18, "text": "水果的，有西瓜和榴莲"}, {"t": 384.87, "d": 9.03, "text": "。 苹果、橙子和一些糕点。"}, {"t": 397.98, "d": 2.44, "text": "这个桃子好大啊。    是的"}, {"t": 399.69, "d": 3.21, "text": "，确实如此。 我不想买两个。"}, {"t": 402.41, "d": 2.89, "text": "没法完成。 对，我们可以把它切成小块，"}, {"t": 404.35, "d": 1.75, "text": "然后分给大家。"}, {"t": 405.2, "d": 2.17, "text": "当然可以。"}, {"t": 409.52, "d": 7.57, "text": "这里有一些现成的三明治。 这是鲑鱼。 我们去弄"}, {"t": 416.14, "d": 2.86, "text": "辆购物车吧； 这是超市购物"}, {"t": 418.04, "d": 9.56, "text": "车。 我现在来推车。 我想要"}, {"t": 426.65, "d": 1.94, "text": "一个这样的贝果。"}, {"t": 429.29, "d": 2.8, "text": "你们俩都想要一个吗？ 还有最后一个"}, {"t": 431.14, "d": 1.25, "text": "。"}, {"t": 431.48, "d": 1.84, "text": "我只要一个。"}, {"t": 432.48, "d": 1.43, "text": "好的。"}, {"t": 433.7, "d": 3.39, "text": "我正在等我的百吉饼。 好的，"}, {"t": 436.16, "d": 3.41, "text": "就放在这里。 好的，谢谢。"}, {"t": 439.12, "d": 2.43, "text": "我正在为我的外国学生拍摄这段视频"}, {"t": 440.59, "d": 1.42, "text": "。"}, {"t": 441.74, "d": 2.29, "text": "哦，你是一位老师。"}, {"t": 443.7, "d": 4.99, "text": "这里有一大瓶啤酒。 小麦"}, {"t": 447.78, "d": 7.53, "text": "啤酒，8.88升。 这里是饮料"}, {"t": 454.36, "d": 2.73, "text": "区，有各种各样的饮料和"}, {"t": 456.14, "d": 6.59, "text": "酒类。 这罐啤酒售价14.9元。"}, {"t": 463.47, "d": 3.9, "text": "这是日本的吗？ 这应该"}, {"t": 466.42, "d": 4.76, "text": "从日本进口。 这款椰子汁"}, {"t": 470.23, "d": 2.76, "text": "是一个非常古老的品牌； 我不知道"}, {"t": 472.03, "d": 4.9, "text": "国外是否有售。 包装设计"}, {"t": 475.98, "d": 4.31, "text": "既有趣又有点搞笑。 这些"}, {"t": 479.34, "d": 2.9, "text": "都是方便面； 这是韩国"}, {"t": 481.29, "d": 4.44, "text": "拉面。 辛拉面。 这些是"}, {"t": 484.77, "d": 3.5, "text": "中国的。 这是意大利面，也"}, {"t": 487.33, "d": 4.05, "text": "叫意大利面条。 这是番茄"}, {"t": 490.44, "d": 3.2, "text": "肉酱意面，这是奶油培根"}, {"t": 492.69, "d": 5.81, "text": "蘑菇意面。 这袋面条"}, {"t": 497.57, "d": 3.19, "text": "11.9，嗯，我还没见过"}, {"t": 499.82, "d": 2.38, "text": "紫番茄辣椒呢。"}, {"t": 503.55, "d": 2.22, "text": "哪里写着辣椒？"}, {"t": 505.46, "d": 2.84, "text": "紫罗兰，紫罗兰是一种蔬菜。"}, {"t": 507.99, "d": 1.33, "text": "哦。"}, {"t": 508.42, "d": 2.13, "text": "它是一种蔬菜。"}, {"t": 510.59, "d": 5.47, "text": "紫色不是一种颜色吗？ 这条通道是卖"}, {"t": 515.14, "d": 5.63, "text": "肉类的：牛肉、猪肉、鸡肉。 这里甚至还有"}, {"t": 519.82, "d": 2.8, "text": "牛肉，把每个部位都展示给你看。"}, {"t": 525.52, "d": 2.86, "text": "这里还有很多小南瓜，"}, {"t": 527.43, "d": 2.67, "text": "包括白色的，它们很"}, {"t": 529.15, "d": 7.75, "text": "漂亮。 橙色和绿色。 这里是"}, {"t": 535.95, "d": 4.26, "text": "海鲜区。 哇，好大的螃蟹！"}, {"t": 540.64, "d": 5.92, "text": "这就是帝王蟹。 这里有"}, {"t": 545.61, "d": 5.1, "text": "各种各样的海鲜。 这是什么品种的龙虾"}, {"t": 549.76, "d": 3.89, "text": "？ 这里应该有很多"}, {"t": 552.69, "d": 5.23, "text": "酸奶。 我在云南吃过这种酸奶，"}, {"t": 556.97, "d": 3.0, "text": "发酵酸奶很特别，"}, {"t": 559.03, "d": 5.19, "text": "配水果吃很好吃。 这是蓝莓"}, {"t": 563.26, "d": 2.84, "text": "味的，我要买一桶酸奶配"}, {"t": 565.15, "d": 3.89, "text": "燕麦粥吃。 我们来挑选一些"}, {"t": 568.1, "d": 5.09, "text": "腌制菜肴吧。 哇，这太"}, {"t": 572.26, "d": 8.61, "text": "罪恶了，居然是皮蛋。 我也想要一个。"}, {"t": 579.92, "d": 6.03, "text": "这是什么？ 肉皮。 好吃吗？ 你"}, {"t": 585.0, "d": 3.17, "text": "可以试试。 那种……不妨"}, {"t": 588.84, "d": 4.74, "text": "试试。 这是豆干。"}, {"t": 595.37, "d": 5.66, "text": "我现在就称一下。 让他们"}, {"t": 600.07, "d": 7.47, "text": "帮我拌好，然后……你"}, {"t": 606.59, "d": 5.05, "text": "不吃葱吗？ 如果可以避免加"}, {"t": 610.7, "d": 2.65, "text": "葱，我通常不会加。"}, {"t": 615.72, "d": 4.56, "text": "现在我们正在排队付款。 您可以在"}, {"t": 619.32, "d": 4.79, "text": "这里自助结账。 这里有自助结账机"}, {"t": 623.16, "d": 2.61, "text": "，那边是收银台"}, {"t": 624.82, "d": 4.4, "text": "。"}, {"t": 628.26, "d": 4.65, "text": "那边的收银台有收银员。 这边是"}, {"t": 631.96, "d": 5.29, "text": "自助结账处。 这是我们刚"}, {"t": 636.29, "d": 2.73, "text": "在超市买的，一大袋"}, {"t": 638.06, "d": 5.19, "text": "。 这个墙面瀑布是"}, {"t": 642.3, "d": 4.8, "text": "装饰品。 我们购物完毕，"}, {"t": 646.15, "d": 4.47, "text": "现在正往回走。 你"}, {"t": 649.66, "d": 3.96, "text": "觉得这家商场怎么样？ 您可以"}, {"t": 652.66, "d": 4.28, "text": "在评论区告诉我。 希望你"}, {"t": 657.88, "d": 2.56, "text": "从今天的视频中学到了一些关于商场和超市的词汇和表达方式"}, {"t": 659.5, "d": 4.84, "text": "。 我会用"}, {"t": 663.39, "d": 2.96, "text": "这种自然的方式教你们中文，"}, {"t": 665.4, "d": 2.32, "text": "今天的视频就到这里，再见。"}], "en_cues": [{"t": 0.03, "d": 2.87, "text": "Now we are waiting for a taxi by the roadside."}, {"t": 2.9, "d": 3.43, "text": "Today we will go to a new shopping mall."}, {"t": 6.47, "d": 3.03, "text": "I’ll take you around and show you what Chinese shopping malls are like."}, {"t": 9.6, "d": 1.4, "text": "I just booked a taxi,"}, {"t": 11.0, "d": 3.07, "text": "and now I'm waiting for the taxi."}, {"t": 16.1, "d": 2.7, "text": "Now we are in the taxi."}, {"t": 19.27, "d": 3.07, "text": "This shopping mall is about 3 kilometers from my home,"}, {"t": 22.33, "d": 3.5, "text": "so it takes around 10 minutes by taxi."}, {"t": 26.1, "d": 1.3, "text": "less than 10 minutes."}, {"t": 27.4, "d": 2.2, "text": "We have arrived at this mall."}, {"t": 29.9, "d": 2.93, "text": "There are many electric scooters parked next to it."}, {"t": 35.13, "d": 2.13, "text": "There is a big restaurant here."}, {"t": 37.27, "d": 1.57, "text": "They serve fish dishes."}, {"t": 39.0, "d": 2.07, "text": "Kenealy Coffee"}, {"t": 41.4, "d": 2.23, "text": "How did KFC become Kenealy Coffee?"}, {"t": 43.63, "d": 2.23, "text": "It's one of its coffee brands, I think."}, {"t": 45.9, "d": 1.5, "text": "It's a coffee brand under it."}, {"t": 49.6, "d": 1.67, "text": "There is also a Starbucks."}, {"t": 51.37, "d": 2.5, "text": "The greening here is quite good."}, {"t": 53.93, "d": 2.47, "text": "We can go down and have a look later."}, {"t": 56.83, "d": 1.9, "text": "There is a walkway here."}, {"t": 59.7, "d": 0.8, "text": "Let's go."}, {"t": 60.93, "d": 3.57, "text": "These hanging lights look very similar to the ones in my hometown."}, {"t": 65.03, "d": 0.97, "text": "Yes."}, {"t": 66.2, "d": 3.13, "text": "The star and moon-shaped lights on the trees"}, {"t": 69.6, "d": 1.87, "text": "It should be beautiful at night."}, {"t": 74.13, "d": 3.53, "text": "Here is a pavilion shaped like a vase."}, {"t": 80.0, "d": 4.73, "text": "Inside, there are benches, chairs, and small tables."}, {"t": 84.93, "d": 1.7, "text": "where you can take a rest."}, {"t": 87.43, "d": 1.67, "text": "It's a bit like a birdcage."}, {"t": 91.1, "d": 1.7, "text": "There is a hot pot restaurant here,"}, {"t": 92.8, "d": 1.6, "text": "It's a chain store."}, {"t": 94.9, "d": 1.57, "text": "There are many here."}, {"t": 97.73, "d": 4.4, "text": "The cinema is on the top floor."}, {"t": 105.33, "d": 3.87, "text": "In the distance, there are some buildings still under construction."}, {"t": 111.1, "d": 2.17, "text": "Now let’s go inside and take a look."}, {"t": 119.63, "d": 2.7, "text": "Wow, the roof is quite beautiful."}, {"t": 123.47, "d": 2.53, "text": "Here are some digital brand stores."}, {"t": 126.0, "d": 3.87, "text": "which are domestic digital brands in China."}, {"t": 132.7, "d": 2.1, "text": "This American pizza restaurant is located in China"}, {"t": 134.8, "d": 3.47, "text": "It’s called Domino’s Pizza."}, {"t": 138.3, "d": 3.8, "text": "This supermarket looks very clean and simple."}, {"t": 144.7, "d": 1.53, "text": "This is taosu."}, {"t": 148.83, "d": 2.03, "text": "Some baked products."}, {"t": 150.97, "d": 1.5, "text": "Here are some breads."}, {"t": 152.67, "d": 1.0, "text": "What is this?"}, {"t": 154.4, "d": 2.1, "text": "Nuts soft baguette."}, {"t": 157.07, "d": 1.83, "text": "It's eleven point eight yuan per bag."}, {"t": 160.23, "d": 1.43, "text": "This is bagel."}, {"t": 161.7, "d": 2.83, "text": "Two bagels are ten point eight yuan."}, {"t": 166.0, "d": 2.83, "text": "And there are some drinks in the distance."}, {"t": 168.83, "d": 2.43, "text": "You don't need to check the ingredient list here."}, {"t": 171.27, "d": 2.03, "text": "It means its ingredient list is very clean."}, {"t": 178.27, "d": 1.33, "text": "Dried figs,"}, {"t": 180.2, "d": 1.43, "text": "crispy salmon snacks."}, {"t": 181.63, "d": 1.7, "text": "It's even steak-flavored."}, {"t": 183.43, "d": 3.27, "text": "These are lemon slices.\nYou can put them in water and drink them."}, {"t": 188.1, "d": 2.3, "text": "This big bag costs 12.8 yuan."}, {"t": 191.63, "d": 2.0, "text": "There are three floors in total."}, {"t": 193.87, "d": 1.63, "text": "How many times can this camera zoom?"}, {"t": 195.53, "d": 1.33, "text": "Can zoom 2x"}, {"t": 196.93, "d": 1.1, "text": "Boutique."}, {"t": 198.73, "d": 1.67, "text": "This is a phone chain."}, {"t": 203.43, "d": 1.2, "text": "It's quite cute."}, {"t": 205.27, "d": 2.07, "text": "There are many plush toys here."}, {"t": 210.43, "d": 1.83, "text": "There is a mirror."}, {"t": 212.27, "d": 2.47, "text": "There are many cute little cups."}, {"t": 215.93, "d": 1.6, "text": "This is a wine glass."}, {"t": 217.7, "d": 1.93, "text": "There are some bracelets."}, {"t": 219.8, "d": 0.87, "text": "They're beautiful."}, {"t": 221.8, "d": 1.87, "text": "And these are earrings."}, {"t": 227.2, "d": 0.77, "text": "necklaces,"}, {"t": 228.0, "d": 1.07, "text": "stress-relief toys."}, {"t": 229.1, "d": 1.63, "text": "It's a keyboard key."}, {"t": 231.53, "d": 1.3, "text": "It's available on Amazon."}, {"t": 233.03, "d": 1.2, "text": "It's also sold on Amazon."}, {"t": 234.43, "d": 0.6, "text": "This is good."}, {"t": 235.03, "d": 0.9, "text": "It also lights up."}, {"t": 236.0, "d": 1.27, "text": "just like my keyboard."}, {"t": 238.1, "d": 1.53, "text": "But the people who actually work will"}, {"t": 239.63, "d": 2.03, "text": "want to use this thing to decompress?"}, {"t": 243.23, "d": 1.27, "text": "press enough every day."}, {"t": 244.5, "d": 0.77, "text": "Yes."}, {"t": 245.27, "d": 3.4, "text": "This is a puzzle."}, {"t": 248.67, "d": 2.07, "text": "This is Xiaomi's electric car."}, {"t": 250.73, "d": 4.67, "text": "It is displayed right in the middle of the shopping mall\nfor people to see."}, {"t": 256.0, "d": 2.5, "text": "Now we’re taking the elevator upstairs."}, {"t": 258.5, "d": 3.3, "text": "This is an arcade area. It’s a little noisy."}, {"t": 264.23, "d": 2.4, "text": "There are many restaurants on this floor."}, {"t": 268.63, "d": 2.27, "text": "These are the massage chairs in the mall."}, {"t": 270.9, "d": 1.8, "text": "If you get tired while shopping,"}, {"t": 272.7, "d": 0.63, "text": "you can sit here and get a massage."}, {"t": 274.8, "d": 4.4, "text": "There is a gym here called California Fitness."}, {"t": 282.23, "d": 4.3, "text": "Now let's take the elevator to the third floor."}, {"t": 286.9, "d": 2.2, "text": "What's on the third floor?"}, {"t": 289.2, "d": 1.33, "text": "There is a cinema."}, {"t": 290.53, "d": 4.57, "text": "Generally, the top floor of a mall in China is a cinema."}, {"t": 295.93, "d": 4.87, "text": "Now we are coming out from the third-floor exit."}, {"t": 301.13, "d": 1.6, "text": "There is a playground."}, {"t": 303.3, "d": 2.2, "text": "It's a place for children to play."}, {"t": 308.2, "d": 1.47, "text": "Oh, there is also a pet rest area over there."}, {"t": 311.2, "d": 1.8, "text": "It's a place for pets to rest."}, {"t": 313.5, "d": 3.1, "text": "It says pet play area."}, {"t": 316.63, "d": 1.97, "text": "Children are not allowed in."}, {"t": 319.13, "d": 2.07, "text": "It's for dogs to play."}, {"t": 322.23, "d": 3.6, "text": "In China, we also call pets fur babies."}, {"t": 325.93, "d": 1.97, "text": "Because they have a lot of fur,"}, {"t": 327.9, "d": 3.3, "text": "and they are like human children to us."}, {"t": 331.47, "d": 0.77, "text": "There are claws."}, {"t": 332.73, "d": 1.93, "text": "pets' paws."}, {"t": 334.7, "d": 2.9, "text": "Now let's take the elevator down, where are we going?"}, {"t": 338.27, "d": 1.57, "text": "Go to the basement."}, {"t": 339.9, "d": 2.33, "text": "Go to the basement."}, {"t": 342.7, "d": 1.17, "text": "Food Court."}, {"t": 345.1, "d": 2.0, "text": "Yes, usually there are some food streets."}, {"t": 347.53, "d": 1.3, "text": "with many different snacks."}, {"t": 349.0, "d": 3.07, "text": "Now we are in the underground parking lot."}, {"t": 352.43, "d": 2.23, "text": "and we need to cross this parking lot."}, {"t": 354.67, "d": 1.4, "text": "There's a supermarket ahead."}, {"t": 357.2, "d": 2.0, "text": "Now we are at this supermarket."}, {"t": 360.0, "d": 1.93, "text": "Here sell some flowers."}, {"t": 361.97, "d": 1.37, "text": "red bean bread,"}, {"t": 364.53, "d": 0.8, "text": "toast,"}, {"t": 365.43, "d": 2.07, "text": "This row is all cooked food."}, {"t": 370.1, "d": 1.23, "text": "These are fish balls."}, {"t": 371.47, "d": 1.03, "text": "A string of fish balls."}, {"t": 372.73, "d": 1.67, "text": "Do I need to pay outside?"}, {"t": 374.4, "d": 1.43, "text": "Check out here."}, {"t": 375.83, "d": 0.9, "text": "You scan me."}, {"t": 382.4, "d": 2.07, "text": "This is the fruit area."}, {"t": 384.63, "d": 7.7, "text": "There are watermelons, durians, apples, and oranges."}, {"t": 392.53, "d": 1.17, "text": "Some pastries."}, {"t": 397.63, "d": 1.67, "text": "This peach is so big."}, {"t": 399.63, "d": 0.87, "text": "Yes, it's hard."}, {"t": 400.5, "d": 1.03, "text": "I want to buy two."}, {"t": 401.67, "d": 1.07, "text": "Crispy peaches are delicious"}, {"t": 402.93, "d": 0.5, "text": "Yes."}, {"t": 403.43, "d": 1.5, "text": "We can cut it open and eat it together."}, {"t": 405.2, "d": 0.8, "text": "Sure."}, {"t": 406.67, "d": 2.73, "text": "There are some ready-made sandwiches here."}, {"t": 411.33, "d": 1.57, "text": "This is salmon."}, {"t": 413.07, "d": 2.2, "text": "Let's go get a shopping cart now."}, {"t": 416.5, "d": 2.57, "text": "This is a shopping cart from the supermarket."}, {"t": 422.4, "d": 2.23, "text": "Now I'll push this shopping cart."}, {"t": 426.47, "d": 1.83, "text": "I want one of these bagels."}, {"t": 429.47, "d": 1.73, "text": "One or one for each of you?"}, {"t": 431.2, "d": 0.9, "text": "just one."}, {"t": 432.1, "d": 0.83, "text": "Okay."}, {"t": 433.03, "d": 1.8, "text": "I'm waiting for my bagel now."}, {"t": 436.43, "d": 1.27, "text": "Okay, just put it here."}, {"t": 437.7, "d": 1.03, "text": "Okay, thank you."}, {"t": 439.27, "d": 2.63, "text": "I took this for my students — they're foreign."}, {"t": 441.9, "d": 0.8, "text": "Are you a teacher?"}, {"t": 443.17, "d": 2.47, "text": "There is a huge beer here."}, {"t": 445.67, "d": 1.4, "text": "wheat beer."}, {"t": 447.07, "d": 1.77, "text": "eight point eight eight liters."}, {"t": 451.0, "d": 2.07, "text": "This is the alcohol and beverage section."}, {"t": 453.07, "d": 4.27, "text": "There are many kinds of drinks and alcohol."}, {"t": 457.53, "d": 4.67, "text": "This can of fruit wine costs 14.9 yuan."}, {"t": 462.63, "d": 1.67, "text": "Is this from Japan?"}, {"t": 464.93, "d": 2.33, "text": "It should be imported from Japan."}, {"t": 467.27, "d": 2.97, "text": "This coconut juice is a very old brand."}, {"t": 470.23, "d": 2.5, "text": "I don't know if it's available abroad."}, {"t": 473.8, "d": 2.03, "text": "Its packaging is a little fun."}, {"t": 476.1, "d": 1.23, "text": "and a little funny."}, {"t": 477.4, "d": 1.83, "text": "Here are all instant noodles."}, {"t": 479.27, "d": 2.13, "text": "This is Korean ramen."}, {"t": 482.3, "d": 0.93, "text": "Spicy Noodles."}, {"t": 483.23, "d": 1.43, "text": "This side has Chinese instant noodles."}, {"t": 484.67, "d": 1.83, "text": "This is pasta."}, {"t": 486.53, "d": 1.7, "text": "It can also be called pasta."}, {"t": 488.23, "d": 3.3, "text": "This is spaghetti with tomato meat sauce."}, {"t": 491.67, "d": 2.23, "text": "Creamy bacon and mushroom pasta."}, {"t": 494.73, "d": 2.8, "text": "A bag of pasta costs eleven point nine yuan."}, {"t": 497.53, "d": 1.7, "text": "Let’s have a look.\nI’ve never seen this before."}, {"t": 500.63, "d": 1.43, "text": "Violet tomatoes."}, {"t": 502.6, "d": 1.03, "text": "Yeah, it's a hybrid."}, {"t": 503.67, "d": 1.23, "text": "Hybrid? Where is it written?"}, {"t": 504.9, "d": 0.93, "text": "Violet"}, {"t": 505.9, "d": 1.3, "text": "Violet is a vegetable."}, {"t": 508.2, "d": 0.3, "text": "Ah."}, {"t": 508.5, "d": 0.63, "text": "It's a vegetable."}, {"t": 509.13, "d": 1.63, "text": "Isn't violet a color?"}, {"t": 514.2, "d": 1.9, "text": "This row is for meat."}, {"t": 516.1, "d": 4.93, "text": "There are beef, pork, and chicken."}, {"t": 521.23, "d": 1.83, "text": "There is even cow here"}, {"t": 523.07, "d": 1.8, "text": "And it tells you the parts."}, {"t": 525.17, "d": 1.9, "text": "There are many small pumpkins here,"}, {"t": 527.13, "d": 1.2, "text": "and white ones."}, {"t": 528.33, "d": 1.17, "text": "which are quite beautiful."}, {"t": 532.13, "d": 1.63, "text": "Orange and green."}, {"t": 534.53, "d": 2.03, "text": "This is the seafood section."}, {"t": 537.27, "d": 1.47, "text": "Wow, what big crabs!"}, {"t": 539.23, "d": 1.63, "text": "This is called king crab."}, {"t": 543.27, "d": 2.07, "text": "There are all kinds of seafood."}, {"t": 547.9, "d": 1.27, "text": "What's this?"}, {"t": 549.17, "d": 1.53, "text": "It should be lobster."}, {"t": 553.17, "d": 1.77, "text": "There are many yogurts here."}, {"t": 555.27, "d": 2.8, "text": "I have eaten this in Yunnan, dry choked yogurt"}, {"t": 558.07, "d": 1.23, "text": "It's quite special."}, {"t": 559.33, "d": 1.9, "text": "It tastes especially good with fruit."}, {"t": 561.47, "d": 1.57, "text": "This is blueberry flavor."}, {"t": 563.27, "d": 2.47, "text": "I’m going to buy a yogurt\nand make an oatmeal bowl."}, {"t": 566.57, "d": 1.47, "text": "Let’s choose some braised food."}, {"t": 571.27, "d": 1.43, "text": "Wow, this is so evil."}, {"t": 572.7, "d": 0.87, "text": "A century egg."}, {"t": 574.07, "d": 1.07, "text": "I’ll take one century egg."}, {"t": 578.87, "d": 1.0, "text": "What is this?"}, {"t": 581.63, "d": 0.87, "text": "Pork skin."}, {"t": 583.37, "d": 0.97, "text": "Is it delicious?"}, {"t": 585.03, "d": 0.87, "text": "You can try it."}, {"t": 586.37, "d": 1.8, "text": "It has a texture similar to fish jelly."}, {"t": 588.17, "d": 0.8, "text": "Try it."}, {"t": 592.97, "d": 1.2, "text": "This is tofu stick."}, {"t": 595.47, "d": 1.9, "text": "Let me weigh it now."}, {"t": 597.67, "d": 1.27, "text": "Let him mix it for me."}, {"t": 598.93, "d": 0.8, "text": "and then weigh it."}, {"t": 605.37, "d": 1.13, "text": "You don’t eat green onions?"}, {"t": 606.87, "d": 2.83, "text": "Green onions?I do eat them. I just usually choose not to add them if possible."}, {"t": 609.9, "d": 0.8, "text": "Ah."}, {"t": 614.7, "d": 2.17, "text": "Now we are queuing up to pay."}, {"t": 619.17, "d": 2.6, "text": "There are self-checkout machines here."}, {"t": 622.67, "d": 1.57, "text": "There are machines here."}, {"t": 624.27, "d": 2.17, "text": "And there are also cashier counters."}, {"t": 627.37, "d": 2.77, "text": "Those counters have staff."}, {"t": 630.3, "d": 2.4, "text": "And this is the self-service checkout."}, {"t": 633.5, "d": 3.4, "text": "This is what we just bought at the supermarket."}, {"t": 636.9, "d": 0.93, "text": "There's a big bag."}, {"t": 639.83, "d": 1.7, "text": "The waterfall on the wall is a decoration."}, {"t": 643.67, "d": 1.97, "text": "We have almost finished shopping."}, {"t": 645.63, "d": 1.5, "text": "Now we're going back."}, {"t": 647.83, "d": 2.3, "text": "What do you think of this mall?"}, {"t": 650.3, "d": 2.1, "text": "You can tell me in the comments section."}, {"t": 652.47, "d": 2.03, "text": "I hope you can"}, {"t": 654.5, "d": 6.17, "text": "Learn some words and expressions about shopping malls and supermarkets"}, {"t": 661.07, "d": 3.6, "text": "I will teach you Chinese in a natural way."}, {"t": 664.7, "d": 2.53, "text": "That's all for today's video, bye!"}], "video_id": "5utVHDzewbY"}